                      (         sub1.asm):02287         * Set Status - Sets the status of a file or device
                      (         sub1.asm):02288         * entry:
                      (         sub1.asm):02289         *       a -> path number
                      (         sub1.asm):02290         *       b -> SS.Tone (function code 98) Sound through termional output device
                      (         sub1.asm):02291         *       x -> duration and amplitude of the tone
                      (         sub1.asm):02292         *            LSB duration in ticks (60 sec) in the range of 0-255
                      (         sub1.asm):02293         *            MSB amplitude of the tone in the range of 0-63
                      (         sub1.asm):02294         *       y -> relative frequency counter (0 = low, 4095 = high)
                      (         sub1.asm):02295         * exit:
                      (         sub1.asm):02296         *       Same as entry
                      (         sub1.asm):02297         * error:
                      (         sub1.asm):02298         *       There are no error conditions set
                      (         sub1.asm):02299         *
                      (         sub1.asm):02300         *  Therefore duration and amplitude passed in accd
                      (         sub1.asm):02301         *                           freq is passed in y
                      (         sub1.asm):02302         
